# ~/.claude holds secrets (.credentials.json), auth caches, conversation
# history, memory, and per-machine state. Deny everything by default, then
# allow-list only the safe, shareable config below.
#
# "/*" ignores only the top level of ~/.claude, so re-including a directory
# (e.g. "!/formatting/") also picks up everything inside it.
# To track a new config file/dir, add a matching "!/..." line.

/*

# --- shareable defaults (safe to commit) ---
!/.gitignore
!/CLAUDE.md
!/settings.json
!/keybindings.json
!/statusline.sh
!/formatting/
!/agents/
!/commands/
!/skills/
!/output-styles/
